**What type of PR is this?**
/kind bug
/kind task


**What does this PR do / why do we need it**:
Eliminate UpdateState between optimizer nodes

// Eliminate UpdateStates between two effect nodes(Assign, Optimizer, or MakeTuple).
// Covert:
// op1 = Node1(para1, value1, ..., u1)
// op2 = Node2(para2, value2, ..., u2)   # u2 == u1
// ...
// t1 = MakeTuple(op1, op2, ...)         or t1 = Optimizer1(..., u1) or t1 = Assign1(..., u1)
// u3 = UpdateState(u1, t1)
// op3 = Node3(para3, value3, ..., u3)
// op4 = Node4(para4, value4, ..., u4)   # u4 == u3
// ...
// t2 = MakeTuple(op3, op4, ...)         or t2 = Optimizer2(..., u1) or t2 = Assign2(..., u1)
// u4 = UpdateState(u3, t2)
// To:
// op1 = Node1(para1, value1, ..., u1)
// op2 = Node2(para2, value2, ..., u1)
// op3 = Node3(para3, value3, ..., u1)
// op4 = Node4(para4, value4, ..., u1)
// ...
// t2 = MakeTuple(op1, op2, op3, op4, ...)
// u4 = UpdateState(u1, t2)

**Which issue(s) this PR fixes**:
Fixes #https://e.gitee.com/mind_spore/dashboard?issue=I3R6TO

